#3201
@BThe Midgaard River, Western Reach@n~
The river broadens slightly beyond the western bridge, running between steep banks
reinforced with old stone and timber. To the north rise the crowded backs of Riverward
buildings, their upper stories leaning toward the water above narrow service yards.
The steady current carries the sounds of the city along the channel.
