#3202
@BThe Midgaard River, Below Riverward@n~
Midgaard's river runs east to west through a deep-cut channel beneath the city. Stone
retaining walls and steep muddy banks make climbing out nearly impossible from the
water. Northward, service lanes and refuse yards sit above the embankment while the
current presses steadily toward the western bridge.
