#3204
@BThe Midgaard River, Warehouse Reach@n~
The river narrows between high stone banks as it passes the warehouse quarter. Timber
loading platforms and shuttered storehouses rise along the northern side, their
foundations darkened by years of spray and floodwater. Farther east, the city wall
closes around the channel where the river enters Midgaard from beneath the hills.
