The Midgaard River enters the city through a broad opening cut low in the eastern wall.
Heavy iron bars descend from the arch into the water, spaced widely enough for the
current but close enough to block boats and large creatures. Beyond them, the river
disappears into a shadowed passage beneath the rising land to the east.
~
